of `challenge/Zeros2000to3000.lean` in `Garald1/zeta-zero-locations`; only the names and the line
breaks differ. The list is data: the conclusions of `ZetaZeroLocations.v3` say what is true of
it, and nothing may assume it is correct. Chunks of at most 300 entries, as in the source.
